<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-13T21:23:52.885Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:23:52 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan is experiencing a wave of train derailments, including one that killed four passengers and injured dozens in Multan and central Pakistan, and another that left six dead and 40 injured. Afghanistan and Pakistan are trading accusations over cross-border terrorism, with Pakistan blaming Taliban fighters for attacks launched from Afghan soil and the Taliban accusing Pakistan of baseless claims while reporting arrests of residents and students after a Panjshir blast. The Taliban also announced that 681 Afghan migrants have returned home via four border crossings. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/12/world/asia/europe-taliban-deportations-migrants.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPR2QxY0N6ajJtbzNhT0xVWUFHMnVZT2FwX0lLdDUzQ3ozTWpDUHVjdkFDQXlHbTVZYTI3eHp1M2o0NE4tNURsSEVkVUNjYVBrWFlHbmZPcUQyYlV6MFR0d1BZd3J4X0QxWjdIeEJFdm51WmdPU3dFWDNjdzBLSkdhblJ6NEs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Brussels Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNVGF1c0NwWmJ4cFcyQTBCdC13b1BYMVpBM3duNUt5ZjhMVHBTdkQ0by1jUkJZWVNTemphaURrbHp4X0dqMzc0eERDYW04VUFJdzg0a0lyejBvRUZvRzNXejhGWU1YcUF5V0lpNi1xUWVMbGJ4d3k4U0lkQ3ZJY1VOaUgyMWhLVjRtZlVz?oc=5&quot;&gt;خبرگزاری اطلس&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOTzVLR2tKcEJpT2tTdjNRZnEzRC1rWGNXVTJwREx5TGpVcGprajZ5RVYzRzYzTk9nMEFiQjNYS01pQnlSVE1WSi1oQWpFS1cycjUtZnJsdTJZUkxjMmZObThnb2FodGl5T1FfUUFkYVFFV3h2b2ctOTU5YXVG